  41++D949 ED 4B 36 DE                  LD BC, (@MapClipWork.SecondPoint.Y)
  42++D94D 2A 31 DE                     LD HL, (@MapClipWork.FirstPoint.Y)
  43++D950 B7                           OR A
  44++D951 ED 42                        SBC HL, BC
